Smallway Desktop MCP

Based on DeskMCP by edmen12 (https://github.com/edmen12/deskmcp).

This independent fork modifies the original desktop software, including multi-tunnel,
multi-workspace, manual Codex handoff and locally approved SSH/API project connections.

Original copyright notices and Apache License 2.0 are retained.
